@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1. LIST 

GET {{baseUrl}}/medicine/
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. CREATE

POST {{baseUrl}}/medicine/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Парацетамол",
    "price": 150.50,
    "quantity_in_stock": 200,
    "expiration_date": "2027-12-31",
    "manufacturer": "Фармстандарт",
    "requires_prescription": false,
    "description": "Жаропонижающее и обезболивающее средство"
}

### 3. RETRIEVE
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicine/203/
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. UPDATE (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/medicine/204/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Парацетамол обновлённый",
    "price": 180.00,
    "quantity_in_stock": 150,
    "expiration_date": "2028-01-15",
    "manufacturer": "Фармстандарт",
    "requires_prescription": false,
    "description": "Новое описание"
}

### 5. DELETE 
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/medicine/206/
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. FILTER

### Поиск по названию
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicine/?search=парацетамол

### Только по рецепту
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicine/?requires_prescription=true